This application ships one add-on inside the build, and that add-on is the work
of someone outside HyperCycle. Its own licence and attribution notice travel
with it:

    bundled-addons/hyperinsight/LICENSE
    bundled-addons/hyperinsight/NOTICE

HyperInsight is the work of @ponchohauncho (https://github.com/ponchohauncho),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. HyperCycle's interest is in the
integration work that made it a MosAIc plugin and then an add-on.

Add-ons installed from the catalogue are not covered here. Each carries its own
licence inside its own directory, which is the shape mosaic-open-platform's
LICENSING.md describes.
